== a-init
machines, named                      machine A (this)
status                               unlocked enrolled
owner exit status 0
== b-enroll
status                               locked not-enrolled
unlock, the secret key given         ok
machines, named                      machine A; machine B (this)
status                               unlocked enrolled
owner exit status 0
== a-rekey
domain status, before any vault verb newMachines [machine B]
status                               unlocked enrolled new: machine B
domain status                        newMachines [machine B]
machines                             machine A (this); machine B
status, after the list               unlocked enrolled
domain status, after the list        newMachines []
rekey, wrong passphrase              denied: wrong passphrase
rekey                                secret key 5-5-5-5-6, a new one: true, pending: none
machines                             machine A (this)
status                               unlocked enrolled
owner exit status 0
== b-after
unlock, the old secret key           denied: wrong secret key: it is not this vault's
status                               locked not-enrolled secret-key-replaced
unlock, the new secret key           ok
status                               unlocked enrolled
machines, named again                machine A; machine B (this)
lock --forget                        ok
owner exit status 0
== a-last
status                               unlocked enrolled
machines                             machine A (this)
owner exit status 0
